<title>JAPAN: Mycal Card plans share split.</title>
<headline>Mycal Card plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mycal Card Co Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1.2-for-1 share split on October 20, for shareholders as of August 31.</p>
